    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST, JOIN DISCORD AND PLAY THE DEMO!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>We combined a <strong>Roguelite Deckbuilder</strong>, a <strong>Turn-Based RPG</strong>, and a <strong>bloodthirsty orc battle-mage</strong>, to create <strong>Korga</strong>! Enter her domain and defeat anyone foolish enough to challenge you.<br>Craft your <strong>Deck</strong>, enhance your <strong>Weapons</strong>, and forge your <strong>Gladiator Emblem</strong> to customize your playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/d6b8dd8d6378371d1bd3d50bcaab9a5c.poster.avif?t=1719933036\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/d6b8dd8d6378371d1bd3d50bcaab9a5c.webm?t=1719933036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/8d682f932e7f5be5730ab337d33fddb9.avif?t=1719933036\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Meet <strong>Korga, Akhvar\u2019s ruthless bounty hunter!</strong><br>Gold has no sway over her; it's the thrill of the hunt and the heads of her prey she values above all. She drags these trophies back to her <strong>Arena</strong>, trapping their souls to relive their defeat over and over.<br>It\u2019s more than just a fight, it\u2019s her pleasure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/fdd082da8ac04d8b405445e987bde6e7.poster.avif?t=1719933036\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/fdd082da8ac04d8b405445e987bde6e7.webm?t=1719933036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/fdd082da8ac04d8b405445e987bde6e7.mp4?t=1719933036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/de395aa5c607981edde891eb0630085a.avif?t=1719933036\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><strong>Korga</strong> might be merciless, but she\u2019s got a twisted sense of hospitality. <br>She can morph the <strong>Arena</strong> with a snap of her fingers to give her captured foes a taste of home before their battle begins anew. Whether it\u2019s the icy chill of the tundra or the scorching heat of a volcano, she ensures every fight is both familiar and fearsome.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/832de7d696f78faf50a430dc7a56de9e.poster.avif?t=1719933036\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/832de7d696f78faf50a430dc7a56de9e.webm?t=1719933036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/832de7d696f78faf50a430dc7a56de9e.mp4?t=1719933036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/23c9683093852181789ae93910dde713.webp?t=1719933036\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Embrace the chaos in a land where every encounter is a leap into the unknown. With ever-changing challenges and choices that could spell victory or downfall, <strong>Korga</strong> is a test of strategy, skill, and adaptability.<br>Will you remain the <strong>Champion of the Arena</strong>, or will you fall prey to your own avarice? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/f3ce3d0bbdc81ab6a8dce19d97b25a79.poster.avif?t=1719933036\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/f3ce3d0bbdc81ab6a8dce19d97b25a79.webm?t=1719933036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/f3ce3d0bbdc81ab6a8dce19d97b25a79.mp4?t=1719933036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/788c0a03a116d313e1d434498d2aac3d.webp?t=1719933036\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br><strong>Deckbuilding</strong> melds <strong>strategic depth</strong> with <strong>build customization</strong>. Add new cards to your deck throughout the game and discover amazing combinations! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/331f3ad7fbe6013f8ef6a9491af01523.poster.avif?t=1719933036\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/331f3ad7fbe6013f8ef6a9491af01523.webm?t=1719933036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/331f3ad7fbe6013f8ef6a9491af01523.mp4?t=1719933036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/d80b64aeb3ee90a3cb789143b05115ab.avif?t=1719933036\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>The <strong>Arena</strong> is an endless challenge, with the glory of victory and gloom of defeat lurking behind every corner. To better prepare for the challenges ahead, <strong>Korga</strong> can progress through the <strong>Spirit Beast</strong> paths and obtain their powers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/92412b0351a30f07ee5be6406f7581b2.poster.avif?t=1719933036\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/92412b0351a30f07ee5be6406f7581b2.webm?t=1719933036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754870/extras/92412b0351a30f07ee5be6406f7581b2.mp4?t=1719933036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
